#\#CIF_1.1
#
# Character string value forms (spec Appendix A <CharString>):
# unquoted strings, single-quoted and double-quoted strings,
# embedded delimiter characters not followed by white space
# (spec para. 15), backslashes without escape meaning (para. 16),
# quoted numerics interpreted as character strings (para. 13).
data_strings

_unquoted_plain        rm
_unquoted_underscore   1_445
_unquoted_unknownish   ?ii
_single_quoted_space   'P 1'
_single_quoted_chem    'C16 H38 N4 2+, C4 H4 O5 2-, 2C H4 O'
_single_quoted_embed   'a dog''s life'
_double_quoted_embed   "He said ""hi"""
_double_quoted_back    "\f scans, and \w scans"
_quoted_numeric        '12'
_quoted_reserved_word  'loop_'
